66
00:04:40,700 --> 00:04:42,364
in the past years.

67
00:04:42,444 --> 00:04:55,477
I also had an accident in November 2021 in which a thirteen year old boy who belonged to a poor family struck me with his motorcycle at a considerably high speed due to which I am handicapped.

68
00:04:55,557 --> 00:04:58,439
I'm really sorry to hear this, but beta Ismina,

69
00:04:58,519 --> 00:05:02,340
