You don't have to mention his economic background. It has nothing to do with how much money is in his father's account or not.

74
00:05:19,980 --> 00:05:28,700
What matters in this situation is that you got into an accident because of his irresponsible behavior and of course his parents' irresponsible behavior.

75
00:05:28,780 --> 00:05:30,700
So we don't mention anyone's such thing.

76
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:33,760
You can correct this.

77
00:05:36,670 --> 00:05:40,610
speed due to which I'm handicapped, I can walk but at a very snail's at.

78
00:05:40,690 --> 00:05:40,990
Add a snail's face with a limp.

79
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:42,610
At a snail's pace with a limp.

80
