84
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:08,040
where pedestrians are paid no regard by the drivers. I feel miserable and deprived as I'm

85
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:14,280
unable to help my family and feel like a burden on them. The accident also posed a hindrance in my

86
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:20,920
CIE examinations, which along with my poor academic performance led me to achieve a below

87
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:25,480
average grade in the exams and I have to repeat the year.

88
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:29,720
Due to my inability to have high intensity workout sessions, I am constantly gaining weight,

89
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:35,800
and consequently all these factors are causing self-esteem issues. I am also facing some family

