00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:45,640
symptoms and have been dealing with suicidal thoughts. My future, whether talking about

92
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:50,440
career, health or marriage seems like a pitch dark tunnel without a ray of light in sight.

93
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,041
and disability both.

