I'm worried for my family as I'm their only son and my suicide could leave a scar on them permanently and they could face financial problems as well.

95
00:07:03,556 --> 00:07:07,565
I fear I will commit suicide as it can be an impulsive decision.

96
00:07:07,645 --> 00:07:18,034
I require your humble opinion on my matter as my life seems like a wreck and I have anxiety that I would not amount to anything and have a miserable life and be a burden on society.

97
00:07:18,114 --> 00:07:19,780
